abstract: Open-source research architecture and public manuscript repository for the RAY-VASC Regenerative Loop program. The
  repository contains the DOI-backed RAY-VASC Thesis, published Papers 1–4, de-identified protocol and baseline materials,
  APPRE schema-and-rules documentation, synthetic data, validation rules, and reproducibility-support artifacts. Papers 5–7
  remain planned work.
